# MF Overhaul 0.4.15: smoke grenade allotment per soldier class (ammo_hum, node = class/date, row = grenade, c1 = four counts per
#   supply level). Vanilla 1943: every Soviet / German rifleman 1, SMG men and leaders 2 -> a 10-man squad throws 10-14 smoke
#   grenades. Real issue was a few per squad: riflemen, AT men, mortar/MG crews 0; SMG men, leaders (pistol classes), sappers 1.
